WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.067
Start on the MML map, with cadastral boundaries visible.

2
00:00:05.067 --> 00:00:10.267
Draw the outer walls. Geometry and angle snapping keep the corners connected.

3
00:00:10.267 --> 00:00:12.633
Create a room directly from its enclosing walls.

4
00:00:12.633 --> 00:00:17.900
Draw a shared partition to divide the floor into two rooms.

5
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:22.100
Move the shared wall. Both room outlines and areas update together.

6
00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:29.967
Set door handing and opening side, or choose a sliding door.

7
00:00:29.967 --> 00:00:31.733
The finished floor plan remains connected and editable.
